---
import RootLayout from '../../layouts/RootLayout.astro';
---

<RootLayout title="Privacy Policy - Azkar | Sayyed Abdul Ali" description="Privacy policy for the Azkar application by Sayyed Abdul Ali.">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-accent-primary hover:underline mb-8">
      &larr; Back to Portfolio
    </a>

    <div class="rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-glass bg-surface-dark border border-glass-border-dark p-8 md:p-12 shadow-glass">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-2">Privacy Policy for Azkar</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8 font-mono">Last updated: 06 March 2026</p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-accent-primary mb-2">1. About Azkar</h2>
          <p>Azkar is a simple dua and dhikr application designed for people of all age groups. It helps users read and recite duas and adhkar in a clean, distraction‑free interface.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-accent-primary mb-2">2. No data collection</h2>
          <p>Azkar does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, share, or sell any personal data or usage data about you.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">In particular, Azkar does not:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-4 mt-2 text-slate-400">
            <li>Require you to create an account or sign in.</li>
            <li>Collect your name, email address, phone number, or any contact details.</li>
            <li>Collect location data, device identifiers, or usage analytics.</li>
            <li>Use third‑party analytics, advertising SDKs, or tracking tools.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">All dua and dhikr content is provided directly in the app and can be used offline. Any preferences saved (such as theme or language) are stored only on your device and are not accessible to us.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-accent-primary mb-2">3. Children’s privacy</h2>
          <p>Azkar is suitable for all age groups, including children. Because we do not collect any personal information from any user, we also do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-accent-primary mb-2">4. Third‑party services</h2>
          <p>Azkar does not display ads and does not integrate any third‑party services that collect user data. If a future version of the app ever includes links to external websites, those websites will have their own privacy policies.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-accent-primary mb-2">5. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the date at the top of this page. Your continued use of Azkar after any change means you accept the updated policy.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-accent-primary mb-2">6. Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or about Azkar, you can contact the developer at:</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400">
            Email: <a href="mailto:help.sayyednaa@gmail.com" class="text-accent-primary hover:underline">help.sayyednaa@gmail.com</a><br />
            Developer: Sayyed Abdul Ali (@Sayyednaa)
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</RootLayout>
